      "description": "Summary nativo con hover sin cambio de padding.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-faq\"><summary>¿Cómo elijo mi turno?<span class=\"ds-pm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"ds-faq-answer\">Abrí el turnero, elegí una prestación y un horario disponible y completá los datos de la reserva.</div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-faq{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,rgba(30,26,22,.13));transition:background-color .2s ease}.ds-faq summary{list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:24px 16px;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--serif,'Newsreader',Georgia,serif);font-size:1.32rem;color:var(--ink,#1E1A16);line-height:1.35;border-radius:var(--r-s,6px);transition:color .2s,background-color .2s}.ds-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-faq summary:hover{color:var(--accent-text,#8E3D1A);background:var(--paper-2,#EAE2D4)}.ds-faq[open] summary{color:var(--accent-text,#8E3D1A);background:rgba(169,75,34,.04)}.ds-faq summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#A94B22);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-pm{position:relative;width:34px;height:34px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--line-strong,rgba(30,26,22,.26));background:var(--paper,#F3EEE5)}.ds-pm::before,.ds-pm::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:14px;height:1.6px;background:currentColor;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);transition:transform .35s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1))}.ds-pm::after{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(90deg)}.ds-faq[open] .ds-pm{background:var(--ink,#1E1A16);border-color:var(--ink,#1E1A16);color:var(--paper,#F3EEE5)}.ds-faq[open] .ds-pm::after{transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}.ds-faq-answer{padding:4px 40px 24px 16px;font-family:var(--sans,'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif);color:var(--ink-2,#463E36);font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.6}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-faq,.ds-pm,.ds-faq-answer{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}"
    },
